[agent:result]   Standard UC permissions needed to create tables still apply: **USE_CATALOG**
[agent:result]   on the parent catalog (or ownership of the parent catalog), **CREATE_TABLE**
[agent:result]   and **USE_SCHEMA** on the parent schema (or ownership of the parent schema),
[agent:result]   and **CREATE_EXTERNAL_TABLE** on external location.
